WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.000
Recognize a test attempt
Account → Payments shows the invoice, amount and current status. The
test notice explicitly says no card or money is involved. Use only the
outcome controls on the matching test record.

2
00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:16.000
Resume the same invoice
A refreshed confirmation page reloads its own latest payment. Check the
invoice reference and amount before continuing; another store cannot
read or simulate this payment.

3
00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Success updates the purchase
The simulated success changed this invoice to Paid and updated its
orders through the existing payment flow. This is local test evidence,
not a bank receipt or real collection.

4
00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:32.000
A closed invoice must not be paid
This separate decline example is cancelled, with stock and credit holds
released. The original total is historical. Continue shopping to create
a new checkout using current prices and availability.
